  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would fail to comply with the terms of clauses A.1 (i) and (ja) of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of Article 3 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (Amendment) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) for the following reasons: \r\nThe eaves of the proposal would be located within 2m of the boundary and project more than 3m in height. The proposal would also attach to a non-original side extension. The total enlargement (being the enlarged part together with existing enlargements of the original dwellinghouse to which it would be joined) would exceed the limits set out in in clause A.1 (j)(iii) because it would extend beyond a wall forming a side elevation of the original dwellinghouse and would have a width greater than half the width of the original dwellinghouse.\r\n"
  ],
